@thatcher_problem 
new-page: true

<button class="tab_button" style="width:45%;" id="important_matters_tab" onclick="window.ChangeTab('right', 'status_right.important_matters', 'important_matters_tab', true);">Back</button>

= The Thatcher Problem

Ross Thatcher is constantly attacking us in the media, aided by close party connections to large media organizations, both within and outside of Saskatchewan. His attacks whip up a populist fervor that our party once commanded under Douglas and turn many of our traditional anti-establishment voters towards him instead. 

Thatcher's Ammunition : [+ thatcher_ammunition : thatcher_ammunition +]


@enacting_medicare
new-page: true

<button class="tab_button" style="width:45%;" id="important_matters_tab" onclick="window.ChangeTab('right', 'status_right.important_matters', 'important_matters_tab', true);">Back</button>

= Enacting Medicare

The implementation of Medicare is bound to be a strenous path. The College of Physicians and Surgeons right now is wholely opposed to the Medicare plan and are currently organizing and demonstrating among the anti-Medicare crowd. 

College-Medicare Stance : [+ college_medicare : college_medicare +]

Anti-Medicare Forces : [+ anti_medicare_strength : militancy +]